---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Our Team - Marker">
  <Navbar />
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pt-16 pb-8 md:pt-24 md:pb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">
        Our Team
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Marker was founded by a technical team of U.C. Berkeley graduates who
        have worked together for over 15 years — building companies, shipping
        products, and solving hard problems in retail.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 pb-16 md:pb-24">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-base text-muted-foreground">
        <p>
          The founding team previously built Drapr, a virtual try-on company backed
          by Y Combinator (S20), and sold it to Gap Inc. After the
          acquisition, they spent over three years embedded inside the
          company, gaining exposure to every function across the
          organization — from individual contributors to the C-suite. They started and ran Gap Inc.'s Generative AI
          program and led cross-functional and cross-brand initiatives,
          including within supply chain.
        </p>
        <p>
          That broad, deep access revealed the pain points that matter most
          and where technology can have the greatest impact. Through
          conversations with peers across the industry — at conferences and
          through personal networks — the team identified and validated a
          set of significant, recurring challenges.
        </p>
        <p>
          With the emergence of large language models, the team believes supply chain processes can be
          automated far beyond what was possible before.
        </p>
        <p>
          Marker was founded to make that a reality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 flex items-center justify-center gap-12">
        <img
          src="/yc-logo.svg"
          alt="Y Combinator"
          class="h-24 grayscale opacity-40"
        />
        <img
          src="/ucb-seal.svg"
          alt="University of California, Berkeley"
          class="h-28 grayscale opacity-40"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 rounded-xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">
          Want to learn more?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">
          We'd love to tell you about what we're building at Marker.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/book-demo"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex h-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-primary/90 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
        >
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
